      <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>㉒ 지방교육세</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p text:style-name="Center">%</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
    </table:table>
    <text:p text:style-name="Body"><text:span text:style-name="Blue">※지방교육세는 기본세액의 25%입니다.[연면적에 대한 세액은 해당없음]</text:span></text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Body">「지방세법」 제83조제3항 및 같은 법 시행령 제84조제1항에 따라 위와 같이 신고합니다.</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Right">년　　월　　일</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Right">신고인　　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Body">인천광역시 부평구청장 귀하</text:p>
    <table:table table:name="첨부서류" table:style-name="T"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>첨부서류</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>건축물의 연면적, 세액, 그 밖의 필요한 사항(임차인 경우 임대차계약서 사본을 말합니다)을 적은 명세서</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p text:style-name="Center">수수료 없음</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table>
    <text:p text:style-name="Center">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈ 자르는선 ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Center">접수증</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="Right">(접수번호　　　　　　)</text:p>
    <table:table table:name="접수증" table:style-name="T"><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray"><text:p>성명(법인명)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">주　소</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Center">년 주민세(사업소분) 신고서 접수증입니다.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray"><text:p text:style-name="Center">접수자　　성명 (서명 또는 인)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray"><text:p text:style-name="Center">접수일</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table>
